# ==============================================================================
# J.A.R.V.I.S — Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# ⚠️ SECURITY NOTICE:
# DO NOT place secret LLM API keys (e.g. OPENAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
# into this frontend application. Any variable with VITE_ is bundled into client-side JS
# and can be inspected by anyone using developer tools.
#
# All API keys and proprietary credentials MUST remain safely on your backend server
# (e.g., Python FastAPI or Node.js Express server).
#
# Set your backend proxy URL below:
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
